      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Quoting process went great. Anna on the phone was polite and decent knowledge of the products they sell with honest feedback on products they have installed. Not the cheapest installer but they've been in business for a while now and hence decided to stick with this mob. However, do consider where the antenna position is and any other items that may impact installation before the day of install. This was not really explained.Installation happened in less than two weeks of deposit payment. Mahmoud and his team were punctual, polite, friendly and helpful in explaining their work and any changes they think was required to the roof. They were tidy in their workThey organised everything with grid so i didn't really have worry about anything that side. Only had to deal with my energy retailer (AGL). The guys struggled a bit with setting up the wireless monitoring as the website of the Inverter manufacturer (Solis) wasn't up to scratch. Figured things on my own with that sense. Wasn't too hard.Early days but so far the experience has been great. Thanks Guys!",
